  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food parcels for single elderly people in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project helps lonely elderly people in Ukraine to have enough food every month and live in decent conditions.  Many of them are unable to move around on their own, buy food and need outside help. Now, during the war, we continue to help them.  Every month, we deliver essential food packages: cereals, porridge, canned food, flour, oil, sugar, tea and other products to help lonely elderly people eat well. We need to continue working on this problem and act quickly to save these people&apos;s lives</narrative>
  </description>
